                            field, name, name
                        ),
                        sp,
                    ));
                }
            }
            let is_record = !path.is_empty() || matches!(next, Tok::Ident(_) | Tok::RBrace);
            if is_record {
                return self.record(path, name, first.span, ctor_span);

